26. Split Full Name Into First and Last Name

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.functions import split

df.withColumn(
    "first_name",
    split("full_name"," ").getItem(0)
).withColumn(
    "last_name",
    split("full_name"," ").getItem(1)
)

SQL:

SELECT
SPLIT_PART(full_name,' ',1) first_name,
SPLIT_PART(full_name,' ',2) last_name
FROM employee;
